// by NEITHER application_argument_does_not_inhabit NOR grounding_evidence_is_source (nst_is_not_
// accepted + nst_fatal_is_something_else PASS). One naming round on the proven procedure:
// bucket membership over the REASON-LEXEME UNIVERSE of the tree route -- every lexeme emitted as
// reason: ^... or cause: ^... in the transitive import closure of {v2.compiler.infer,
// v2.compiler.resolve, v2.test.lens_common.infer_fixture, the witness module, v2.std.constraints,
// v2.compiler.inhabitance} (94 files, 509 lexemes; a python closure walk at this head -- the
// discovery procedure, cited by method). The TREE imports the CLAIM'S OWN builders
// (byte-identical to c8cc1df9c8d1), so probe and claim cannot drift. Exactly one bucket PASSes
// plus the universe guard, or the universe guard FAILs and the fatal is outside every closure
// mint site -- the extraction itself is then the suspect, a bigger finding than the label.

